# REPO_STAGING exists to establish intellectual property, not project
# posterity. The authored methods are the record: scripts, notes, designs.
# Data produced BY those scripts is regenerable and is not tracked.
#
# History is deliberately NOT rewritten -- for an IP record the commit
# timestamps are the evidence, so earlier commits keep whatever they hold.
# These rules govern the tip from here on.

# --- experiment output directories -------------------------------------
**/Research/**/raw/
**/Research/**/raw_all/
**/Research/**/lanes/
**/Research/**/trickle_store/
**/Research/**/trickle_raw/
**/Research/**/trickle_lanes/
**/Research/**/matrices*/
**/Research/**/jit_out_*/

# --- generated data and visualisations anywhere under Research/ --------
**/Research/**/*.json
**/Research/**/*.jsonl
**/Research/**/*.csv
**/Research/**/*.html

# the private scrub area stage.sh copies into before anything touches the tree
.stage_tmp/

# --- the RESULT OF RECORD is tracked, however it is spelled -------------
# Added 2026-09-09 (the owner: "i want the proofs that we have so far and the
# algorithms used ... in essence the intellectual property").  The rules
# above exclude generated data by EXTENSION, which also excluded the
# artifacts that ARE the result: the proof stores, the opcode model table,
# the dictionary, the pool.  A proof is not bulk intermediate data; it is
# the finding.  These paths are tracked, and they win over the rules above.
!**/Research/**/autopoly*_runs.jsonl
!**/Research/**/autopoly*.json
!**/Research/**/expand*_runs.jsonl
!**/Research/**/expand*.json
!**/Research/**/handful*.json
!**/Research/**/model_table*.json
!**/Research/**/single_opcode_units.json
!**/Research/**/unique_opcodes.json
!**/Research/**/opcode_signatures.json
!**/Research/**/ledger_signatures.json
!**/Research/**/per_opcode_*.json
!**/Research/**/rust_facts*.json
!**/Research/**/go_facts*.json
!**/Research/**/coverage_table.json
!**/Research/**/dictionary.json
!**/Research/**/check_L2.json
!**/Research/**/model_L2.json
!**/Research/**/the_pool5.json
!**/Research/**/the_families5.json
!**/Research/**/types101_*.json
!**/Research/**/pool100_edges.json
